  "system": {
    "description": "The change is not finished with you, and sometimes you let it work. Once per day, as a free action (◇), you let the beast rise. Until the end of the encounter, your melee attacks deal +d4 damage and you have Boon on Strength tests, but you cannot speak and you have Bane on Sanity tests. When it ends, test Sanity (DR12). Failure: You are Fatigued (or gain one more level of Fatigued if you already are). Ruin: As Failure, and the change takes another step: the Dark Master describes a new, lasting change to your body.",
